    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1131">

                <pb facs="0942" n="826" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg826"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/14739.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Garrett to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Nuevo Laredo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-30T11:00:00-06:40">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 30, 1915—11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>General Ricaut has twenty-nine wounded whom he desires to send through Texas to
                    Matamoros today. Has not yet availed himself of permission given in your March
                    20, 4 p.m. Can wounded be moved on former order, with battle on at
                    Matamoros?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Garrett.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
